1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,872
Lirien: Another leaf fell. Countless times we witness this scene, but the insecurity in our hearts never subsides.

2
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:14,156
Elandra: Lirien! Did you hear the bell from the square? More people have fallen!

3
00:00:15,568 --> 00:00:24,688
Lirien: Elandra, don't raise your voice here. The Lady of Life is watching us all. The fate of who comes next cannot be changed.

4
00:00:26,388 --> 00:00:33,828
Elandra: I found ancient records. The leaf did not fall naturally, it was manipulated by a strange energy in the canyon.

5
00:00:35,936 --> 00:00:45,944
Kaelen: What are you two talking about? The king had just ordered an increase in patrols. Anyone who dares to come near Co Thu will be arrested immediately.

6
00:00:46,444 --> 00:00:54,220
Kaelen: But… I also saw the imprint on Nesta's hand. She only has a few days left, Lirien.

7
00:00:54,720 --> 00:01:00,672
Nesta: I don't want to die... Uncle Kaelen, Lirien, help me. Why me?

8
00:01:02,492 --> 00:01:11,588
Lirien: Nesta, calm down. We'll find a way. Elandra is right, I can't wait for death to fall on her head anymore.

9
00:01:13,144 --> 00:01:19,792
Elandra: Tonight, we have to go to Misty Canyon. It contained the answer to all the mysteries of the last leaf.
